+  // WolfWeb: a pinned tab keeps its page. A bookmark opened while it's the
+  // tab in use (bookmarks bar, bookmark menus, the bookmark manager) opens in
+  // a new tab instead; the same address stays put, and so do bookmarklets
+  // (javascript: bookmarks run on the page they're used on).
+  if (params->disposition == WindowOpenDisposition::CURRENT_TAB &&
